><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c:</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
> A detailed evaluation of these comprehensive&#xD;models in three very highly ranked international&#xD;swimmers suggests that impulse–response&#xD;modelling for this level of the athlete may be useful&#xD;in conjunction with other monitoring methodologies.&#xD;When using models such as those presented&#xD;it may be informative for coaches and scientists to&#xD;examine how far from the predicted level of performance&#xD;a swimmer is.</span
></p
></body
